      "role": "supports",
      "locator": "Document 12, Decretum Theudis regis, pp. 262–264: expenses, witnesses, horses, inclusion in the Theodosian collection and Toledo dating clause."
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "source:castilla-la-mancha-recopolis",
      "role": "supports",
      "locator": "Introduction and Sobre este lugar: foundation in 578 in honour of the king’s son, the commercial street rising to the palace and church, and the site near Zorita de los Canes."
