      "sourceId": "source:schibille-recopolis-glass-2017",
      "role": "supports",
      "locator": "Introduction, paragraphs 1–3: three furnaces south of the palace, earliest workshop dated from the foundation to the first half of the seventh century, vessels, crucibles and workshop and residential samples."
