      "sourceId": "source:canellas-hispano-visigothic-documents",
      "role": "supports",
      "locator": "Documents 35–36, pp. 278–279: opening and subscriptions to the 589 profession of faith, including Reccared, Queen Baddo and the confirming edict. The editor identifies the later copy."
